{"server":"tw","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_08_end","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_08","title":"過去與現在的交會","storyCode":"CW-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"666ab90124bd8e2557a45696d6b0ffb182b270563c0ca359132a813b4e099660","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g8_storage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我命令你回答我，僕從。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"僕、僕從......？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我可不是凱爾希的僕從......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......Dr.{@nickname}失去了記憶。博士並不是你認識的那些人中的任何一個，不再是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士現在是泰拉的一員，羅德島的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經共同經歷了許多，直至今日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，“失憶”。為什麼你不把所有事情重新告訴這個......“博士”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你始終在懷疑這個“博士”的真實性。比起復原一段不再可信的記憶，你更相信一個重新認識世界的他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......也不奇怪。地面上發生的一切都做不得假，如果真的有足夠的干預，泰拉不該是如今的形態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來並沒有任何事情如我們所願。儘管你不記得了......Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是多麼難得的機會。在這裡，遇見你們。卻是這樣的情況......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，失憶的“Dr.{@nickname}”與自稱凱爾希的AMa-10，你們來這裡又是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克麗斯騰讓你們感到緊張嗎？這一切超出了你們的控制嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好像還沒有回答我的問題。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"別這麼高高在上！","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"自我介紹是平等交談的開始。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是計劃的人格模擬，數萬年來始終守望著這座黑暗的大廳，還有數十萬同胞冰冷的身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我曾是最後的希望，一次悲觀的嘗試，一個虛無主義的代名詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，或許對渺小的你們而言......我是克麗斯騰瘋狂計劃的幫兇和幕後黑手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是行將就木的“保存者”，敬畏你眼裡的所有，我是文明的消亡本身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g15_energywell_glowed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"位置沒錯，傳導物質的反應......很強烈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶著我的祝福，走到了這裡，也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......是為了阻止我而來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有鬆開我送你的武器，我很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來你也並不是因為一腔熱血才站在這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你最後的機會了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抽身而出，還是繼續？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會......學著成為您所說的戰士的，雅拉主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你很清楚，克麗斯騰不會把聚焦發生器接收的能量對準大地上任何一處城鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有必要阻止她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是和所有科學家一樣，準備向無人曾踏足的地方前進罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧，雅拉主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不如您一樣瞭解總轄，但如果是您說的話，我願意相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我會繼續試著停下這一切，就算是您擋在我面前也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，如果總轄就這麼進行了她無論是什麼的實驗，並且獲得了成功——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道，她可是萊茵生命的總轄，無論是出於情感上的信任還是理性的判斷，她都很有可能成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您認為，哥倫比亞的研究者們會怎麼看待她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在萊茵生命的人力資源考察科工作了這麼久，這裡的人您再瞭解不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克麗斯騰會成為哥倫比亞科學界的英雄和偶像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她會成為科學家的榜樣，成為研究者的標杆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......然後，這樣的事就再也不會停止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一樁一樁，一件一件，研究者們樂此不疲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，雅拉主任，只有她是克麗斯騰·萊特，只有她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的那些自詡引領者與天才的人呢？其他的那些被這種所謂的“不擇手段的拓荒精神”鼓舞的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他那些將自己的偏執或理想付諸實踐，無所顧忌的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些貪婪的，狂妄的，冒進的，頑固的，與我們一樣的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們都把如同萊茵生命的總轄一般行事作為美德——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是您，一定能想像到，那是怎樣一種未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們都不用想像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您對萊茵生命已經做過的那些研究，也從來不是一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚，赫默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚，特里蒙，不，哥倫比亞的國土內，曾發生過，且正發生著多少這樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾有無數瘋狂而誘人的計劃擺在我的面前，拿出這些東西的人眼神明亮，笑容真誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們衷心地以為他們在為“純粹的科學”效力，是我們認知原野的拓荒者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您和您的同僚們，只需要評估他們的實驗計劃裡，宏偉藍圖下，會不會偶爾也要付出一點點“代價”和“損耗”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“代價”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種代價有時是一片肥沃的土地，有時是若干個絕症病人或者死刑犯；有時是一個村落或一個城鎮，有時是某個特定的種族乃至國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，也有時，是他們自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您對此恐懼嗎，雅拉主任？還是，您也為了科學進步的可能性而興奮不已？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任，這世上從來沒有裝在玻璃罩裡的“純粹的科學”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科學在我們的手掌中，在人的手掌中。您必須知道它的溫度，它的重量，它是否灼人，它會帶來什麼痛苦或是慰藉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人永遠聲稱自己是在前進，可他們只是胡亂把腳伸向自己想踐踏的地方而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，赫默，這就是前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人知道路在哪，他們只能這麼走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸運者找對了地方，走入光明中。不幸者闖進死胡同，兜兜轉轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你沒辦法讓他們停下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己也是研究者，你知道什麼最無法阻擋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是渴求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"物質束縛不了它，道德束縛不了它，規則也同樣束縛不了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上，從古至今，在克麗斯騰之前，你說的那些貪婪的、狂妄的、冒進的、頑固的人們，他們又何曾停下過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，今後，他們必須停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起碼，在真正俯身看清自己的腳下到底是什麼之前，他們必須停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任，我覺得——科學的燃料不該是欲望與理想，也不該是計算與取捨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科學是真切地看向每一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你說了一句很漂亮的話，適合被掛在大學圖書館的走廊裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但恐怕沒有哪個研究者願意讓這句話出現在實驗室的牆上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是句空話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我會讓它落實的，雅拉主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想中途放棄，我還帶著您的祝福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，克麗斯騰花了很長時間準備這項計劃，我不知道她為此付出了多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她的覺悟一定不會比她的父母要少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......不是你，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我無法眼睜睜地看著，希望又一次淪為泡影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，雅拉主任，您希望的又是什麼？見證克麗斯騰的成功，還是讓她平安無事地回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識位叫露比的研究員，她最大的希望是按時下班，順利退休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才遇到的一位士兵先生，我想他現在唯一希望的事就是從這座失控的能量井平安離開，帶著親戚們從特里蒙的科學瘋子手中逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與他們相比，總轄的希望更高貴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為她想要的東西，足夠“進步”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是只是因為，您與她之間的感情，足夠緊密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任，您知道這並不公平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不能這麼自私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......就是這麼自私，我沒辦法用道德或正義欺騙自己，然後放你過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須承認感情的重量，克麗斯騰的那個夢，我沒辦法袖手旁觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫默，你不會不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果我們能阻止總轄，她也許還會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚......當她開始這項計劃的時候，就沒有打算再回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從很早之前，甚至，在我們初見時，這一切......就已經無法挽回了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，對於你能擋在我的面前，我很欣慰。我甚至可以說，我支援你的主張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，作為克麗斯騰的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......家人，我依然不會讓你通過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我看看吧，你真的......準備好承擔你所說的話了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今後將要面對的，不再是一個帕爾維斯或者克麗斯騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要面對的，是所有試圖前進的人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的，我必須準備好，我向您保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科學必須前進，也勢必前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，有的人，比如總轄，他們更擅長“前進”的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也必須有人站出來，確保科學——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依然在人的手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g8_storage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......“保存者”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有想到，居然真的是您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果是您，又怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"協助一隻小動物的瘋狂計劃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還是目睹一個年幼文明踏出搖籃的第一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你來得太晚了，“博士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的等待......已經失去了意義。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"和眼前的事比起來，特里蒙發生的一切都好像不值一提。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"......我需要更多解釋。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是您在幫助克麗斯騰。她以某種手段與您有所接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉的歷史、文化、語言、種族、科技水準，透過哥倫比亞的網路，我已盡數知曉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可笑的是，如今地面上的資訊傳輸甚至無法做到覆蓋全球，而你們相互毀滅的手段，倒是有了合格的演化效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉的手段過於原始且依賴源石，以這樣的轉換率，想實現克麗斯騰的嘗試......需要的能源也是匪夷所思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉幾乎不可能有技術手段解決這一難題。除非——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我把最後的血給了她，供養一顆新的心臟，也許好過守著一盞將熄的燈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您竟然，真的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼不惜如此？這是您在這麼漫長的時間裡的所有努力......全都白費了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，白費了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"計劃被我親自關閉，指令由我親自輸入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我不容懊悔的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很快了，很快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的震動從遠處蔓延而來，地下空間的燈光閃爍了幾下。\n那位自稱“保存者”的存在沉默了片刻，又好像是深深歎了一口氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"怎、怎麼了？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"難道是能量井？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這只是嬰兒好奇的一瞥——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卻要跨越什麼樣的阻礙？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:11 P.M. 能量井異常蓄能"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g15_energywell_glowed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那家叫羅德島的企業給了你很好的訓練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手臂還能抬得起來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的手臂呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我買了醫療保險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還要繼續嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果您依然擋在我的面前的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那就繼續。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，情況有些不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的溫度......就算是能量井準備發射，這裡也不至於升到這種溫度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍方為了停止蓄能，幾乎把這裡所有的能源都切斷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括所有的安全警報和控制系統？那幫蠢貨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快！我們必須離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面還有一些駐紮的士兵，雅拉主任，拜託您帶他們離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制系統的能源被切斷了，為什麼總轄還能實現對這裡的遠程操作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳導物質的反應還在增強，我......還有機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i15_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"熱浪炙烤著雅拉的臉，那個她從前並未那麼在意的黎博利研究員，正繼續向能量井的更深層跑去。\n雅拉突然覺得，什麼東西都無法成為那個身影的阻礙。\n也許，她答應過自己的事，真的會做到。\n她想，到了那時候，自己或許能幫上一點忙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i15_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來發射的準備工作已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“科學是真切地看向每一個人。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我可不是科學家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克麗斯騰，你會飛上你所夢想的深空之中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你一定會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜斯提，你沒有選個視野更好的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你什麼時候才能不繼續煩我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去萊塔尼亞考察的時候，曾看過萊塔尼亞人的煙火慶典，他們會邀請最好的作曲家，專門為這場慶典譜曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當第一朵煙火綻放，音樂家們就會一齊演奏，那場面，嘖嘖，真是漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的修辭過於貧乏，萊塔尼亞人不會喜歡你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不過，我們今天居然在特里蒙看到了同樣燦爛的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懸浮在天頂的圓環，無人機的子彈曳出的光雨，裝甲上濺射出的火花......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不比煙火慶典差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算算時間，演奏該進入高潮部分了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該有一個震撼人心的強音——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i10"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這......比我想像的還漂亮，萊茵生命該向城市裡所有欣賞到這一幕的人收費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......成功了，聚焦發生器的材料和結構暫時抵抗住了能量束的衝擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來是充能和聚焦階段，只要能收集到這種高壓條件下的讀數......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，軍方和梅蘭德的人恐怕會抓住最後的機會，阻止聚焦的完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你就不擔心總轄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她什麼時候需要我們擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是同行者，我們只是同行者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們只需要做好自己的事，然後......祝她好運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（薩卡茲語）若有一天，卡茲戴爾亦懸於天頂，我將在火爐上鐫刻你的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]}]}
